The sprint board is built in Exact, with the interface in `/tmp/claude-0/runs/r15/board-contract-haiku-5/app.contract` and the data module in `/tmp/claude-0/runs/r15/board-contract-haiku-5/app.ts`. All 26 visible tests pass after four `./check` runs and two `./test` runs. Unsure points: the loads and writes go through mutations, not resources, so the board can hold optimistic state; a declined move followed by an accepted move on a queued card may leave server and screen out of step; and the hidden tests and the visual look were not checked.